# The Listening Mirrors' echo caves (CIPlay the_listening_mirrors_caves, 11-12 w10; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points
# as in its recipe: a kit_sys dug into Watcher's Fell's foot - mouth one at -43 36.6 (ground ~5.5), the trunk on at
# yaw 240 to -54.3 30.1 bending to -52.8 27.5, mouth two at -38 27.9 (ground ~6) by -44.9 23.9 joining it there, the
# side chamber off the trunk -52.2 32.5 .. -56.9 36.7; the sign at -33 36. In at one mouth, out at the other, then
# into the chamber and back.
island The Listening Mirrors keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at -31 34.5 h=7
wait 2
read ECHO CAVES
# (11-13 cavemix, TODO 0f) the cave's boar: alive, on the dug floor under the hill's rock, then dealt with
expect animals Warthog 1
expect animalsinside Warthog 1
wait 2
picture lm_boar -52.4 7.3 32.8 -54.6 6 34.6 aim=Warthog light=20
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
picture lm_cave_out -30 11 40 -41 6.5 32
walk -38.7 39.1 to -43 36.6 to -48.6 33.4 to -54.3 30.1 to -52.8 27.5 to -44.9 23.9 to -38 27.9 to -33.7 30.4 below=12
walk -38.7 39.1 to -43 36.6 to -51.7 31.6 to -52.2 32.5 to -54.9 34.8 below=12
picture lm_cave_in -52.4 7.3 32.8 -56.4 6.2 36.3 light=20
walk -54.9 34.8 to -52.2 32.5 to -51.7 31.6 to -43 36.6 to -38.7 39.1 below=10
